      "rev_n_1_5c2b2e_0": {
        "revision_id": "rev_n_1_5c2b2e_0",
        "node_id": "n_1_5c2b2e",
        "thought_text": "Convert the strings $s$ and $t$ into their integer representations (base 26) by treating them as numbers where 'a'=0, ..., 'z'=25. Calculate the median value as $(val(s) + val(t)) / 2$ using integer division, then convert this median integer back to a string of length $k$. This approach directly handles the arithmetic of the lexicographical range.",
        "parent_revision_path_hash": "root",
        "replaces_revision_id": null,
        "feedback_id": null,
        "created_at": 1794506593.6298249
      },
      "rev_n_2_0cc785_0": {
        "revision_id": "rev_n_2_0cc785_0",
        "node_id": "n_2_0cc785",
        "thought_text": "Perform the addition of the two strings as if they were numbers in base 26, carrying over values from right to left. Once the sum is computed, divide the resulting number by 2 to find the median. Finally, convert the result back to the string format. This avoids potential issues with extremely large integers if the language's arbitrary precision arithmetic is slow, though Python handles it well.",
        "parent_revision_path_hash": "root",
        "replaces_revision_id": null,
        "feedback_id": null,
        "created_at": 1794506593.6298394
      },
      "rev_n_3_3b6b7e_0": {
        "revision_id": "rev_n_3_3b6b7e_0",
        "node_id": "n_3_3b6b7e",
        "thought_text": "Use a digit-by-digit approach starting from the most significant character. Determine the median character at each position by considering the carry from the previous position (right to left) and the constraints imposed by $s$ and $t$. This simulates the arithmetic operation without explicitly constructing the full large integer, optimizing for memory if $k$ were significantly larger, though for $2 \\cdot 10^5$ the integer conversion is efficient enough.",
        "parent_revision_path_hash": "root",
        "replaces_revision_id": null,
        "feedback_id": null,
        "created_at": 1794506593.629847
      },
      "rev_n_4_0133d6_0": {
