        "node_id": "n_5_de1333",
        "thought_text": "Perform digit-by-digit addition of $s$ and $t$ in base 26 with carry propagation to find the sum, then divide by 2 digit-by-digit from right to left to avoid handling massive integers. This is more memory-efficient for very large $k$.",
