        "thought_text": "Perform the addition of $s$ and $t$ digit-by-digit from right to left with manual carry handling to get the sum, then divide by 2 digit-by-digit from right to left to find the median without relying on full big-integer arithmetic. This is efficient and avoids potential overhead of converting the entire string to a massive integer.",
